{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:tsconfig.server.json",
    "title": "服务端 TypeScript 配置",
    "summary": "该配置定义 NodeNext、ES2023、严格类型检查及服务端相关源码范围，是服务端应用、共享契约与若干开发和评审脚本的共同 TypeScript 基线；仅凭配置不能证明这些入口均已实现或能成功运行。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "compiler-baseline",
        "title": "编译与类型检查基线",
        "body": "配置以 ES2023 为输出目标，同时把模块格式和解析策略设为 `NodeNext`，并启用 Node 类型、`strict` 与 `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`。这些设置面向现代 Node.js 环境，并要求索引访问显式处理可能缺失的值；`esModuleInterop` 提供 CommonJS 互操作便利，`skipLibCheck` 则跳过依赖声明文件检查。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "source-scope",
        "title": "纳入范围与事实边界",
        "body": "检查范围覆盖服务端源码、共享 contracts，以及开发、review 启动、wiki 和 knowledge 等脚本；输出目录声明为 `dist`，根目录为项目当前目录。[[c2]] 这只能证明文件被纳入 TypeScript 项目，不能证明对应功能已实现、已执行或测试通过。根 `tsconfig.json` 继承本配置并关闭输出，因此经根入口检查时不会生成 `dist` 文件。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "服务端编译器选项",
        "reason": "支持 ES2023、NodeNext、严格检查、Node 类型及相关互操作选项的配置说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:tsconfig.server.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 1
        },
        "quote": "{\"compilerOptions\":{\"target\":\"ES2023\",\"module\":\"NodeNext\",\"moduleResolution\":\"NodeNext\",\"strict\":true,\"esModuleInterop\":true,\"skipLibCheck\":true,\"outDir\":\"dist\",\"rootDir\":\".\",\"types\":[\"node\"],\"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\":true},\"include\":[\"apps/server/src/**/*.ts\",\"packages/contracts/src/**/*.ts\",\"scripts/dev.ts\",\"scripts/dev-review.ts\",\"scripts/dev-review-vite.ts\",\"scripts/review-wiki.ts\",\"scripts/review-knowledge.ts\"]}"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "服务端项目源码范围",
        "reason": "支持该 TypeScript 项目涵盖服务端、共享契约及多类开发和评审脚本的论断。",
        "relation": "tracks",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:tsconfig.server.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 1
        },
        "quote": "{\"compilerOptions\":{\"target\":\"ES2023\",\"module\":\"NodeNext\",\"moduleResolution\":\"NodeNext\",\"strict\":true,\"esModuleInterop\":true,\"skipLibCheck\":true,\"outDir\":\"dist\",\"rootDir\":\".\",\"types\":[\"node\"],\"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\":true},\"include\":[\"apps/server/src/**/*.ts\",\"packages/contracts/src/**/*.ts\",\"scripts/dev.ts\",\"scripts/dev-review.ts\",\"scripts/dev-review-vite.ts\",\"scripts/review-wiki.ts\",\"scripts/review-knowledge.ts\"]}"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "根配置关闭输出",
        "reason": "说明服务端配置虽声明 `dist`，但通过根配置入口运行时会被 `noEmit` 限制为只检查。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:tsconfig.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 4
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"extends\": \"./tsconfig.server.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": { \"noEmit\": true }\n}"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
